
Step 1: Create database and insert one student

javascript

```javascript
use college

db.students.insertOne({
  rollNo: 101,
  name: "Arun",
  dept: "CSE",
  marks: 78,
  city: "Chennai"
})
```

Step 2: Insert four more students

javascript

```javascript
db.students.insertMany([
  {
    rollNo: 102,
    name: "Priya",
    dept: "ECE",
    marks: 85,
    city: "Delhi"
  },
  {
    rollNo: 103,
    name: "Karthik",
    dept: "CSE",
    marks: 62,
    city: "Chennai"
  },
  {
    rollNo: 104,
    name: "Rahul",
    dept: "IT",
    marks: 75,
    city: "Jaipur"
  },
  {
    rollNo: 105,
    name: "Suresh",
    dept: "CSE",
    marks: 91,
    city: "Trichy"
  }
])
```

Step 3: Display all students and only CSE students

javascript

```javascript
db.students.find()

db.students.find({ dept: "CSE" })
```

Step 4: Update marks of roll number 103 to 68

javascript

```javascript
db.students.updateOne(
  { rollNo: 103 },
  { $set: { marks: 68 } }
)
```

Step 5: Add semester 3 to every CSE student

javascript

```javascript
db.students.updateMany(
  { dept: "CSE" },
  { $set: { semester: 3 } }
)
```

Step 6: Delete student with roll number 104

javascript

```javascript
db.students.deleteOne({ rollNo: 104 })
```

Step 7: Display total remaining students

javascript

```javascript
db.students.countDocuments()
```

Final Output# 4

Total students remaining

5 students inserted − 1 student deleted = 4 students

### Important commands for viva

| Command | Use |
| --- | --- |
| `insertOne()` | Insert one record |
| `insertMany()` | Insert multiple records |
| `find()` | Display records |
| `updateOne()` | Update one record |
| `updateMany()` | Update multiple records |
| `$set` | Add or change a field |
| `deleteOne()` | Delete one record |
| `countDocuments()` | Count records |
